 that if you sign up for a call with a quick turnaround\, we will do our 
 very best to make it happen! However\, it may be subject to a reschedule
 .\n\nLocation: +1 262-707-9898\n\nPlease share anything that will help p
 repare for our meeting.: Wanting to train for my first duathlon at potat
 o creek next june. I found out my left leg is longer than my right 2 yea
 rs ago and heel lift has helped. However\, I’m still dealing with signif
 icant stiffness in my hips and tightness down my left hamstring.\n\nNeed
